<BaseLayout title="Privacy Information | FenceCraft" description="Privacy information for FenceCraft enquiries and contact details.">
  <section class="wrap page-title"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy information.</h1><p class="intro">We use the details you choose to share to understand and respond to your enquiry.</p></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow editorial"><h2>Enquiries</h2><p>FenceCraft currently handles quote enquiries by phone and email. Please share your name, postcode, the service you need, a short project description and a preferred contact number. Park enquiries should also include the park or site location, approximate scope and preferred timing.</p><p>Online enquiries are not currently collected through this website. The delivery provider, lawful basis, retention period and access arrangements must be confirmed by the business owner before that option is made available.</p><h2>Contact alternatives</h2><p>You can call <a href="tel:+447935190681">07935 190681</a> or email <a href="mailto:info@fence-craft.co.uk">info@fence-craft.co.uk</a>.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>No analytics or advertising cookies are included in this site.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
